{"unit_id":"jyao-SUSE-power-group__dsh-provider-rate-limit#card-zh","repo":"jyao-SUSE-power-group/dsh-provider-rate-limit","commit":"457e462962f83f193a5eb260da47ed138b0f43a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-provider-rate-limit 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的限流插件，通过 llm/stream 钩子按供应商和模型的路由限制请求。它提供令牌桶、等待或拒绝模式、上游 429 冷却退避和并发数控制，也能按 URL 规则改写出站请求头。设置页支持热更新，并在聊天输入区显示实时统计。适合需要控制模型请求速率、队列和网关身份头的 Harness 用户；无需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:944-1019","lib/client.js:1102-1160"]}
{"unit_id":"jyao-SUSE-power-group__dsh-provider-rate-limit#card-en","repo":"jyao-SUSE-power-group/dsh-provider-rate-limit","commit":"457e462962f83f193a5eb260da47ed138b0f43a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-provider-rate-limit limits DeepSeek Harness LLM traffic by provider and model. Token buckets queue or reject calls, with optional 429 backoff and concurrency caps. URL rules can rewrite request headers. A bilingual settings card provides live controls and usage statistics.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:944-1019","lib/client.js:1102-1160"]}
